      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": [
          "I understand that the financial impact of the recent outages is a critical factor for you.\u202fHere\u2019s what we can offer to help offset the downtime and demonstrate our commitment to making things right:",
          "",
          "| **Remediation Option** | **What it Covers** | **How it\u2019s Calculated** | **When it\u2019s Applied** |",
          "|------------------------|--------------------|------------------------|-----------------------|",
          "| **Service\u2011Credit Credit** | 1\u202f% credit of the monthly fee for each full day of downtime beyond the SLA (up to 30\u202fdays). | Credit = (Downtime days \u00d7 1\u202f%) \u00d7 Monthly fee | Applied to the next billing cycle |",
          "| **Extended Support Hours** | 24\u2011hour on\u2011call support for the next 90\u202fdays (no additional cost). | No extra charge | Immediate |",
          "| **Priority Incident Response** | 30\u2011minute response window for any future incidents. | No extra charge | Immediate |",
          "| **Free Feature Add\u2011on** | One additional premium feature (e.g., advanced analytics, custom dashboards) for 6\u202fmonths at no cost. | No extra charge | Immediate |",
          "",
          "### How we\u2019ll determine the exact credit",
          "",
          "1. **Audit the downtime** \u2013 We\u2019ll provide a detailed log of the outage periods (start/end times, affected services).  ",
          "2. **Calculate the credit** \u2013 Using the 1\u202f% per day rule, we\u2019ll compute the total credit amount.  ",
          "3. **Issue the credit** \u2013 The credit will be applied to your next invoice, and we\u2019ll send you a formal credit note for your records.",
          "",
          "### What you can expect next",
          "",
          "- **Within 24\u202fhrs**: We\u2019ll send you the outage audit report.  ",
          "- **Within 48\u202fhrs**: We\u2019ll confirm the credit amount and apply it to your account.  ",
          "- **Immediate**: The extended support hours and priority response will be activated.",
          "",
          "We\u2019re committed to restoring your confidence in our service, and we believe this combination of financial relief and enhanced support will help you feel secure moving forward. Please let me know if this meets your expectations or if there\u2019s anything else you\u2019d like to discuss."
